\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Scenario C --- Unitree G1 official model (33.3\,kg, 29~DOF), fixed stance, 8\,N step pHRI. D7 achieves 2.5$\times $ lower SS error than D1 on real G1 hardware parameters. The residual 3.9\,mm SS error (vs.\ 0.037\,mm on the simplified biped) arises from the 5\,Hz position-actuator bandwidth attenuating fast MPC corrections. D4--D6 are omitted for readability and reported in Table~\ref {tab:scenarioC}.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scenarioC}{{3}{8}{Scenario C --- Unitree G1 official model (33.3\,kg, 29~DOF), fixed stance, 8\,N step pHRI. D7 achieves 2.5$\times $ lower SS error than D1 on real G1 hardware parameters. The residual 3.9\,mm SS error (vs.\ 0.037\,mm on the simplified biped) arises from the 5\,Hz position-actuator bandwidth attenuating fast MPC corrections. D4--D6 are omitted for readability and reported in Table~\ref {tab:scenarioC}}{figure.3}{}}
